{"id":"aube","lemma":"aube","pos":"noun","rank":1882,"glosses":["paddle, blade","vane (of windmill)","small plank"],"ipa":"/ob/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/da/Fr-aube.ogg/Fr-aube.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"aubes"},"formAudio":{"aubes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-aubes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"On part dès l'aube.","en":"We leave at dawn.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1095672","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"share"},{"g":"from, as soon as"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"J'étais debout avant l'aube.","en":"I was up before dawn.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102953","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"standing"},{"g":"before"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Il est venu à l'aube.","en":"He came at dawn.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Je me suis réveillé avant l'aube.","en":"I awoke before dawn.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1097812","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"awake"},{"g":"before"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"L'ennemi a attaqué à l'aube.","en":"The enemy attacked at dawn.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"enemy"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to attack","l":"attaquer"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}